<!--
    BugFix-MRP v0.0.25: view 2325 mrp.production form (27336b).
    THE big DEFERRED.md item. Un-defers cleanly now that v0.0.23 shipped
    cost sub-models + O2M inverses.

    Byte-verbatim arch from Clear-DB except:
      * Numeric ref name="617" -> %(mrp.act_mrp_block_workcenter_wo)d
        (Block Workcenter act_window on the workorder_ids tablet tree).

    Field-ref audit (re-scout post-v0.0.23):
      * 145 unique field refs across 7 models. ZERO real missing:
        - mrp.production (67 refs): all resolve (some via pre-existing
          fields on models/mrp_production.py, others via the 4 O2M
          inverses declared in v0.0.23).
        - mrp.workorder (many refs via workorder_ids nested form + tree):
          all base fields, mrp_workorder dep.
        - quality.check (7 refs via workorder.check_ids): all base,
          new quality dep.
        - stock.move (21 refs via move_raw_ids nested form): all base,
          stock dep.
        - mrp.workcenter.productivity (2 refs via workorder.time_ids
          nested tree): all base, mrp dep.
        - x_mrp_bom_material_cos/labour_cost/overhead_cos/general_cost:
          all fields resolve on child models ported in v0.0.23.
      * stock.lot.x_studio_production_order (in lot_producing_id domain,
        line 170): pinned to BugFix-Stock, already in deps since v0.0.20.

    Modifier ref analysis (undeclared): 0 x_studio_ modifier refs.
    All modifier fields are either declared as top-level <field> in
    the arch or are base fields on the target model.

    studio_approval attributes: 10 occurrences (permissive attribute
    tolerated, per v0.0.21 4830 validation).

    New deps this version: purchase_stock, quality, quality_mrp,
    quality_mrp_workorder, stock_delivery. All 5 confirmed installed
    on repair-test-101. None have BugFix-* deps, so all edges stay
    acyclic. Required by field refs on mrp.workorder and stock.move
    (quality bridge tables, delivery bridge tables) inside the nested
    workorder + stock.move forms.
-->
